{"ID":"20240513083052-gpf6ixp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083052-gpf6ixp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083052-gpf6ixp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164809-mpj20yx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164809-mpj20yx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:402,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164809-mpj20yx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:466,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:466\u0026#125;","title":"254","type":"doc","updated":"20240514163501"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513164809-mpj20yx","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 940px;","id":"20240513164809-mpj20yx","updated":"20240514163501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      初診日期：2008/04/04"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"200-2 L, J"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16, very thin"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/04/04"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後舌不麻，手足冷下了。但晚上因太熱而無法睡。身熱重，但降溫的時間縮短了(以前最久要兩天才能降溫)。手足色紅亦退。曬太陽時幾乎無法呼吸(因此人毛孔閉塞)。小腿皮膚乾癢(汗因為毛孔閉塞過久汗想要出來但是出不來)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診\n口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴有了，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腋下及委中(膕窩)有汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身多數熱，無關節痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生理期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正常。2~3周後月經來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無惡寒了。不惡風、無頭項強、無噁心、有時心跳很快(因為內太熱，心臟想將毛孔打開但打不開，胸中的熱散不出來)、無咳嗽、服藥後小便量增加不多、嗅覺正常、無心臟病史。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈稍浮數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表邪沒有透發。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛根五錢 桂枝三錢 白芍三錢 炙甘草二錢 大棗十枚 生薑兩片麻黃二錢 杏仁三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六碗煮兩碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1) 此人病已走表回到病之初。若能表汗透發，水循環回復正常，則不會身熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2) 此人因毛孔閉塞過久，故需要使用麻黃來將毛孔打開。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}